 "note": "Typed as other by its code; the PDF page continues HODG-7 (stage III-IV classic Hodgkin lymphoma, Preferred: BrECADD + G-CSF x 2 cycles, restaging by FDG-PET/CT, BrECADD + G-CSF x 2 or x 4 cycles, second restaging, ISRT, repeat PET at 12 weeks, biopsy, follow-up HODG-12 or primary refractory disease HODG-13). Boxes, arrows and conditions written from the PDF page image and text. Only the first restaging (Deauville 1-3 / 4-5) has a condition; the second and later restagings and the three biopsies repeat variables the schema holds once, so they carry none.",
